data: {"id": "566c28e0e8054a99-thinking-parallel_evidence-1082", "run_id": "566c28e0e8054a99", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n**1. Pod 当前状态**\n- `aiops-case-v08/workload` 仍处于 **CrashLoopBackOff**。\n- Pod phase: Running（调度成功），但 container `app` Ready=False，restarts=13。\n- Last State: Terminated，**Exit Code=127**，Reason=Error。\n\n**2. 启动命令与资源配置 (Pod YAML)**\n- `command: [\"sh\", \"-c\", \"exec /opt/app/unavailable-command\"]`\n- Image: `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`\n- Limits: CPU=50m, Memory=32Mi；Requests: CPU=5m, Memory=8Mi。\n- restartPolicy=Always。\n\n**3. 崩溃前日志**\n- 最后一次终止前的日志输出为：`sh: exec: line 0: /opt", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789134479977, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

